  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/661/661-3.htm",
  "statuteText": "661:3 Duties; Privileges. –\n\nA person appointed or elected to fill a vacancy in a public office shall, during the unexpired term, perform the same duties as did his predecessor, be subject to the same requirements as was his predecessor and be entitled to the same privileges and emoluments as was his predecessor."
